---
pagination: { data: monthlyPages, size: 1, alias: mpage }
permalink: "{{ '/' if mpage.lang == 'en' else '/es/' }}monthly/{{ mpage.key }}/index.html"
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageKey: monthly
bodyClass: mp-page
pageScripts: ["/assets/js/monthly.js"]
eleventyComputed:
  lang: "{{ mpage.lang }}"
  # `| safe`: the layout escapes the title and description once (no "&amp;amp;" in the tab / share preview)
  title: "{{ ('monthly.month_title' | t(mpage.lang, { month: (mpage.key | mpMonth(db, carry, site, mpage.lang)).title })) | safe }}"
  description: "{% set mm = mpage.key | mpMonth(db, carry, site, mpage.lang) %}{{ (('monthly.month_desc' | t(mpage.lang, { month: mm.title, theme: mm.gv.theme })) if mm.gv else ('monthly.month_desc_plain' | t(mpage.lang, { month: mm.title }))) | safe }}"
---
{#- ONE month of /monthly/: the poster (1080 × 1350, scaled to fit; Download PNG / Share / Print) and that
    month's full toolkit beside / below it, with previous / next month links.
    Pages: this month + the next 12 (monthlyPages, eleventy/filters/monthly.js) × en / es.
    The rule (monthly.js): every month page shows that month's PLAN — the poster, the issues' themes, the
    "put it to work" tips, the dates, the weekly open meetings, the stories wanted, Book of the Month —
    and the same month as a message for a group chat or an e-mail (#mp-message: 4 texts, one language or
    both, WhatsApp or e-mail; mpMessage). The CURRENT month's page also shows what is live now (mpNow): the
    dates already over — marked "Over" and folded under "Earlier in …" (src/assets/js/monthly.js keeps the
    marks up to date between builds) —, the next committee meeting once this month's is over, the next
    issue when it is already online, only the Book of the Month offers not over, and "Keep up all month"
    (#mp-keep: pointers to the daily quote, What's New, the Bulletin, Instagram, the subscription price —
    never copies of them); a notice points to next month's page once the visitor's month has changed and
    the site has not been rebuilt yet (data-mp-newmonth).
    Order: hero → in-page nav → the poster (sticky from 1024px) · the toolkit: message · the magazines ·
    put it to work · dates · every week · stories wanted · Book of the Month · keep up → pager. Headings:
    h1 (hero) → h2 (the toolkit) → h3 (its cards) → h4 (each magazine).
    One home per fact — this page links there: the hub (/monthly/) of the 10 ways; /shop/#botm of the
    prices; /events/ and /meetings/#committee-meeting of the events' details and the Zoom link;
    /contribute/ of how to send a story; /read/ of the stories (an issue's highlights are the monthly
    digest's, the month they came out).
    The Dates card links the month's calendar file ("Add October's dates to my calendar": m.icsUrl, written
    by src/pages/monthly-ics.11ty.js — the dates and the story deadlines, no script needed).
    A machine-translated theme (a Grapevine theme on the Spanish page, a La Viña one on the English page) carries
    the site's mark: the magazine's own words in italics under it with the translation icon, and the note
    "Titles translated automatically … — originals in italics" (/read/'s), or the icon alone inside a line. -#}
{% import "macros/ui.njk" as ui with context %}
{% import "macros/monthly.njk" as mp with context %}
{%- set m = mpage.key | mpMonth(db, carry, site, lang) -%}
{%- set all = db | mpMonths(carry, site, lang) -%}
{%- set L = site.links -%}
{%- set pageAbs = m.url | siteUrl(site) -%}
{%- set other = lang | otherLang -%}
{#- what is live now: the current month only -#}
{%- set nx = (db | mpNow(site, lang)) if m.isCurrent else null -%}
{%- set views = mpage.key | mpIssues(db, carry, site, lang) -%}
{#- Book of the Month: the current month keeps the offers not over yet -#}
{%- set botmShown = [] -%}
{%- for b in m.botm %}{% if not (m.isCurrent and b.past) %}{% set _n = botmShown.push(b) %}{% endif %}{% endfor -%}
{%- set gvmLive = nx.gvm if nx else null -%}
{#- the site's mark after a machine-translated theme inside a line (contribute.njk's): the icon, its words for
    screen readers; and the note under a list with originals in italics (read.njk's) -#}
{%- set mtMark -%}<span class="auto-note align-middle" title="{{ 'common.auto_translated' | t(lang) }} — {{ 'common.auto_translated_help' | t(lang) }}">{% icon "languages", "size-3" %}<span class="sr-only">{{ "common.auto_translated" | t(lang) }}</span></span>{%- endset -%}
{%- set mtNote -%}<p class="auto-note mt-3">{% icon "languages", "size-3" %} {{ ("read.mt_note_en" if lang == "es" else "read.mt_note_es") | t(lang) }}</p>{%- endset -%}

{#- Eyebrow: "Monthly toolkit", or "Monthly toolkit · This month" for the current month.
    The hero's right-hand card (the shared hero aside, from 1024px): the covers of that month's issues when
    the magazines have published them (db.articles issues — the toolkit below names the themes, never the
    covers), each linking to its issue on the official site; the card's link goes to /read/. A month
    without a published cover yet (most months ahead) shows the months around it instead — the toolkits
    just before and after, each with its magazine theme — linking to them (the hero's own button already
    goes to "All months", and the pager with the month names is at the very end of the page).
    "hide": the poster stays the first thing on smaller screens. -#}
{%- set covers = [] -%}
{%- for p in (["lv", "gv"] if lang == "es" else ["gv", "lv"]) %}{% set iss = m[p] %}{% if iss and iss.cover and iss.url %}
  {%- set _n = covers.push({ src: iss.cover, href: iss.url, title: ("La Viña" if p == "lv" else "Grapevine"), text: iss.label, alt: "" }) -%}
{%- endif %}{% endfor -%}
{%- set around = [] -%}
{%- if not covers.length -%}
  {#- the month before and the month after (at either end of the window: the two nearest on one side) -#}
  {%- for j in [m.index - 1, m.index + 1, m.index - 2, m.index + 2] %}{% if around.length < 2 and j >= 0 and j < all.length %}{% set _n = around.push(all[j]) %}{% endif %}{% endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
{% call(slot) ui.pageHero(lang, m.title, "monthly.month_sub" | t(lang, { month: m.monthName }), "calendar-heart", ("monthly.month_eyebrow_now" if m.isCurrent else "monthly.month_eyebrow") | t(lang), { side: "hide" }) %}
{%- if slot == "side" %}
  {%- if covers.length %}
  {{ ui.heroAsideMedia("monthly.hero_covers" | t(lang), covers, lang, { id: "mp-aside-title", icon: "book-open", ratio: "portrait", href: "/read/" | lurl(lang), linkLabel: "nav.read" | t(lang), class: "mp-hero-covers" }) }}
  {%- elif around.length %}
  {%- set links = [] -%}
  {%- set pubs = ["lv", "gv"] if lang == "es" else ["gv", "lv"] -%}
  {%- for x in around | sort(false, false, "index") -%}
    {#- its magazine theme (the page language's magazine first); the icon tile takes that magazine's colour -#}
    {%- set thm = [] -%}{%- for p in pubs %}{% if not thm.length and x[p] and x[p].theme %}{% set _n = thm.push({ pub: p, text: ("La Viña" if p == "lv" else "Grapevine") ~ ": " ~ x[p].theme }) %}{% endif %}{% endfor -%}
    {%- set _n = links.push({ href: ("/monthly/" + x.key + "/") | lurl(lang), label: x.title, text: (thm[0].text if thm.length else ("monthly.month_eyebrow" | t(lang))), icon: "calendar-heart", tone: (thm[0].pub if thm.length else "grape") }) -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {{ ui.heroAsideLinks("monthly.hero_around" | t(lang), links, lang, { id: "mp-aside-title", icon: "calendar-range", class: "mp-hero-around" }) }}
  {%- endif %}
{%- else %}
<div class="hero-actions">
  <a class="btn-light" href="{{ '/monthly/' | lurl(lang) }}">{% icon "layout-grid", "size-4" %} {{ "monthly.back_hub" | t(lang) }}</a>
</div>
{%- endif %}
{% endcall %}

{#- The in-page nav (a long page: up to 9 cards). The current month also carries a notice the browser shows
    once the visitor's month (Central time) is the next one while this build is still last month's
    (src/assets/js/monthly.js): it points to that month's page. -#}
<div class="container-page page-overlap">
  {{ ui.pageNav([
    { href: "#mp-poster", label: "monthly.nav_poster" | t(lang), icon: "image" },
    { href: "#mp-message", label: "monthly.nav_message" | t(lang), icon: "message-circle" },
    { href: "#mp-issues", label: "monthly.issues_title" | t(lang), icon: "book-open-text" },
    { href: "#mp-dates", label: "monthly.dates" | t(lang), icon: "calendar-days" },
    { href: "#mp-weekly" if (m.weekly.length or gvmLive) else "", label: "monthly.every_week" | t(lang), icon: "video" },
    { href: "#mp-stories", label: "monthly.stories_wanted" | t(lang), icon: "pen-line" },
    { href: "#mp-botm" if botmShown.length else "", label: "monthly.botm" | t(lang), icon: "book-heart" },
    { href: "#mp-keep" if nx else "", label: "monthly.keep_title" | t(lang), icon: "sparkles" }
  ], lang) }}
  {% if m.isCurrent and m.hasNext %}
  <p class="mt-3 rounded-xl border border-lv bg-lv-soft px-4 py-3 text-sm" data-mp-newmonth="{{ m.next }}" data-mp-newmonth-text="{{ 'monthly.newmonth' | t(lang) }}" role="status" hidden>
    <a class="tap-link inline-flex items-start gap-2 font-semibold text-lv-strong underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href="{{ ('/monthly/' + m.next + '/') | lurl(lang) }}">{% icon "calendar-heart", "mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0" %}<span><span data-mp-newmonth-label>{{ "monthly.newmonth" | t(lang, { month: all[m.index + 1].monthName }) }}</span> <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a>
  </p>
  {% endif %}
</div>

<section class="section container-page pt-6 sm:pt-8 mp-print-root" aria-labelledby="mp-toolkit-title">
  <div class="mp-layout">
    <div class="mp-poster-col" id="mp-poster">
      <div class="mp-stage" data-mp-stage>
        <div class="mp-fit">{{ mp.poster(m, lang, site, "p") }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="mp-actions mp-no-print">
        <button type="button" class="btn-primary" hidden data-mp-download data-file="{{ m.fileName }}" data-working="{{ 'monthly.working' | t(lang) }}" data-done="{{ 'monthly.saved' | t(lang) }}" data-failed="{{ 'monthly.failed' | t(lang) }}">{% icon "image-down", "size-4" %} {{ "monthly.download" | t(lang) }}</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn-secondary" hidden data-mp-share data-file="{{ m.fileName }}" data-url="{{ pageAbs }}" data-title="{{ m.title }} — {{ site | pick(lang, 'title') }}" data-text="{{ 'monthly.share_text' | t(lang, { month: m.label, url: pageAbs }) }}" data-copied="{{ 'monthly.link_copied' | t(lang) }}">{% icon "share-2", "size-4" %} {{ "monthly.share" | t(lang) }}</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn-secondary" data-js-only onclick="window.print()" title="{{ 'monthly.print' | t(lang) }}">{% icon "printer", "size-4" %} {{ "monthly.print_short" | t(lang) }}</button>
      </div>
      <p class="mp-hint mp-no-print">{% icon "info", "size-4 shrink-0" %} {{ "monthly.poster_hint" | t(lang) }}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mp-toolkit mp-no-print">
      <div>
        {{ ui.sectionHead("monthly.toolkit" | t(lang), "monthly.toolkit_intro" | t(lang), "", "", "calendar-heart", { eyebrow: m.title, id: "mp-toolkit-title", class: "mb-1! sm:mb-2!", lang: lang }) }}
        {% if m.isCurrent %}{{ ui.freshness(site.built, lang, { note: true }) }}{% endif %}
      </div>

      {#- The month as a message: the poster's text version for a group chat or an e-mail (mpMessage). Four
          texts are written into the page — WhatsApp / e-mail × this language / both — and the choice of
          language is the digest's too (localStorage "gv-digest-bi"). Without JavaScript the previews still
          open and their text can be selected; the choice and the Copy buttons need it (data-js-only). -#}
      <section id="mp-message" class="card card-pad" aria-labelledby="mp-message-title" x-data="mpMessage">
        <h3 id="mp-message-title" class="card-h"><span class="text-vine">{% icon "message-circle", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "monthly.msg_title" | t(lang) }}</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ "monthly.msg_text" | t(lang) }}</p>
        <fieldset class="mt-4" data-js-only>
          <legend class="sr-only">{{ "community.digest.lang_label" | t(lang) }}</legend>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1 rounded-full border border-line bg-surface-2 p-1">
            <label class="cm-seg"><input type="radio" name="mp-msg-lang" value="one" class="sr-only" :checked="!bi" @change="setBi(false)" checked><span>{{ "community.digest.lang_only" | t(lang) }}</span></label>
            <label class="cm-seg"><input type="radio" name="mp-msg-lang" value="bi" class="sr-only" :checked="bi" @change="setBi(true)"><span>{{ "community.digest.lang_bi" | t(lang) }}</span></label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-js-only>
          <button type="button" class="btn-primary min-w-0 grow basis-48" @click="copy('wa', $el)">{% icon "message-circle", "size-4" %} {{ "community.digest.copy_wa" | t(lang) }}</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn-secondary min-w-0 grow basis-48" @click="copy('email', $el)">{% icon "mail", "size-4" %} {{ "community.digest.copy_email" | t(lang) }}</button>
        </div>
        {#- (.mp-msg-previews: edge to edge in the card at large text on a phone — areas/monthly.css) -#}
        <div class="mp-msg-previews mt-4 divide-y divide-line overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-line">
          <details class="cm-preview">
            <summary class="flex min-h-12 cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-ink">{% icon "message-circle", "size-4 shrink-0 text-vine" %} {{ "community.digest.preview" | t(lang) }}</summary>
            <pre id="mp-msg-wa-one" class="cm-pre" x-show="!bi" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label="{{ 'community.digest.wa_label' | t(lang) }} ({{ 'community.digest.lang_only' | t(lang) }})">{{ m.key | mpMessage(db, carry, site, [lang], "whatsapp") }}</pre>
            <pre id="mp-msg-wa-bi" class="cm-pre" x-show="bi" x-cloak role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label="{{ 'community.digest.wa_label' | t(lang) }} ({{ 'community.digest.lang_bi' | t(lang) }})">{{ m.key | mpMessage(db, carry, site, [lang, other], "whatsapp") }}</pre>
          </details>
          <details class="cm-preview">
            <summary class="flex min-h-12 cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-ink">{% icon "mail", "size-4 shrink-0 text-gv" %} {{ "community.digest.preview_email" | t(lang) }}</summary>
            <pre id="mp-msg-email-one" class="cm-pre" x-show="!bi" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label="{{ 'community.digest.email_label' | t(lang) }} ({{ 'community.digest.lang_only' | t(lang) }})">{{ m.key | mpMessage(db, carry, site, [lang], "email") }}</pre>
            <pre id="mp-msg-email-bi" class="cm-pre" x-show="bi" x-cloak role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label="{{ 'community.digest.email_label' | t(lang) }} ({{ 'community.digest.lang_bi' | t(lang) }})">{{ m.key | mpMessage(db, carry, site, [lang, other], "email") }}</pre>
          </details>
        </div>
        {% if m.isCurrent %}
        {#- one job each: the message is for a group chat; the district meeting has its own report -#}
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ "community.digest.report_hint" | t(lang) }} <a class="link tap-link inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold" href="{{ '/monthly/' | lurl(lang) }}#report">{% icon "clipboard-list", "size-4 shrink-0" %} {{ "community.digest.report_link" | t(lang) }}<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></a></p>
        {% endif %}
      </section>

      {#- The magazines of the month (La Viña first in Spanish): the theme; once the issue's stories are on the
          site, how many (and how many free to read), the official issue page and all its stories on /read/
          (mpIssues — no highlight list: those are the monthly digest's). The current month adds a line for
          an issue already online before its month, pointing to that month's toolkit. -#}
      {%- set pubs = ["lv", "gv"] if lang == "es" else ["gv", "lv"] -%}
      <section id="mp-issues" class="card card-pad" aria-labelledby="mp-issues-title">
        <h3 id="mp-issues-title" class="card-h"><span>{% icon "book-open-text", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "monthly.issues_title" | t(lang) }}</h3>
        {% for p in pubs %}
        {%- set x = m[p] -%}
        {%- set v = (views | selectattr("isLv") | first) if p == "lv" else (views | rejectattr("isLv") | first) -%}
        {% if x or v or p == "gv" %}
        {%- set issueUrl = (x.url if x else "") or (v.url if v else "") -%}
        <section class="mp-mag mt-4" aria-labelledby="mp-mag-{{ p }}">
          <p class="eyebrow {{ 'text-lv' if p == 'lv' else 'text-gv' }}">{% if p == "lv" %}{{ "monthly.in_lv" | t(lang) }} · {{ x.label if x else v.label }}{% else %}{{ "monthly.in_gv" | t(lang, { month: m.monthName }) }}{% endif %}</p>
          {#- La Viña's theme of an issue not out yet may have no English words yet: its language is marked -#}
          <h4 id="mp-mag-{{ p }}" class="h-card mt-1 text-xl"{% if x and x.theme and x.themeLang and x.themeLang != lang %} lang="{{ x.themeLang }}"{% endif %}>{{ (x.theme if x else "") or (v.theme if v else "") or ("monthly.no_issue" | t(lang)) }}</h4>
          {{ mp.orig(x, lang, "es" if p == "lv" else "en") }}
          {% if v and v.count %}
          <p class="meta-row mt-1 text-sm text-muted">
            <span>{{ ("read.n_stories_one" if v.count == 1 else "read.n_stories") | t(lang, { n: v.count }) }}</span>
            {% if v.free %}<span>{{ "community.wn.free_n" | t(lang, { n: v.free }) }}</span>
            {% else %}<span title="{{ 'read.subscriber_help' | t(lang) }}">{% icon "lock", "mr-1 size-3.5 align-[-0.1em]" %}{{ "community.wn.subscriber_all" | t(lang) }}</span>{% endif %}
          </p>
          {% endif %}
          {% if issueUrl or (v and v.count) %}
          <p class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-1">
            {% if issueUrl %}<a class="link tap-link inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold" href="{{ issueUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" hreflang="{{ 'es' if p == 'lv' else 'en' }}">{{ "monthly.issue_link" | t(lang) }} {% icon "arrow-up-right", "size-4 shrink-0" %}<span class="sr-only"> ({{ "common.external" | t(lang) }})</span></a>{% endif %}
            {% if v and v.count %}<a class="link tap-link inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold" href="{{ v.readHref | lurl(lang) }}">{{ "monthly.all_stories" | t(lang, { n: v.count }) }} {% icon "arrow-right", "size-4 shrink-0" %}</a>{% endif %}
          </p>
          {% endif %}
        </section>
        {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
        {%- set mtIssues = (m.gv and m.gv.machine and m.gv.orig) or (m.lv and m.lv.machine and m.lv.orig) -%}
        {% if mtIssues %}{{ mtNote | safe }}{% endif %}
        {% if nx %}{% for o in nx.outNext %}
        <p class="panel-muted mt-4 p-4! text-sm leading-relaxed">{{ ("report.i_out_lv" if o.pub == "lv" else "report.i_out_gv") | t(lang, { issue: o.issue, theme: o.theme }) }}{% if o.machine %} {{ mtMark | safe }}{% endif %}{% if o.monthUrl %} <a class="link tap-link gap-1 font-semibold" href="{{ o.monthUrl | lurl(lang) }}">{{ "monthly.open_month" | t(lang, { month: o.monthLabel }) }}<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></a>{% endif %}</p>
        {% endfor %}{% endif %}
      </section>

      {#- Put it to work: every tip for this month's Grapevine issue (config/carry.yml; the hub shows two, the
          poster up to three, the message three) and the 10 ways on the hub -#}
      {% if m.tips.length %}
      <section id="mp-tips" class="card card-pad" aria-labelledby="mp-tips-title">
        <h3 id="mp-tips-title" class="card-h"><span class="text-lv">{% icon "lightbulb", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "monthly.put_to_work" | t(lang) }}</h3>
        {% if m.gv %}<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">{{ "monthly.tips_sub" | t(lang, { month: m.monthName, theme: m.gv.theme }) }}{% if m.gv.machine %} {{ mtMark | safe }}{% endif %}</p>{% endif %}
        <ul class="mp-tiplist mt-4" role="list">
          {% for tp in m.tips %}
          <li><span class="mp-tipicon">{% icon tp.icon, "size-5" %}</span><span class="min-w-0"><strong class="block text-ink">{{ tp.title }}</strong><span class="text-sm text-muted">{{ tp.text }}</span></span></li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        {% if carry.ways.length %}<a class="link tap-link mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold" href="{{ '/monthly/' | lurl(lang) }}#ways">{{ "monthly.ways_link" | t(lang) }} {% icon "arrow-right", "size-4 shrink-0" %}</a>{% endif %}
      </section>
      {% endif %}

      {#- Dates. The current month: what is still to come first (a row whose time passes while the page is
          open is marked "Over" by the browser: data-mp-over), the next committee meeting once this month's is
          over, and the dates already over folded under "Earlier in …" (full contrast, the "Over" badge says
          it in words). A later month: every date. -#}
      {%- set upcoming = [] -%}{%- set earlier = [] -%}
      {%- for d in m.dates %}{% if m.isCurrent and d.past %}{% set _n = earlier.push(d) %}{% else %}{% set _n = upcoming.push(d) %}{% endif %}{% endfor -%}
      {% macro dateRow(d) %}
      {%- set over = m.isCurrent and d.past -%}
      <li class="mp-drow{{ ' is-past' if over }} flex gap-3 py-3"{% if m.isCurrent %} data-mp-over="{{ d.overAt }}"{% endif %}>
        <span class="mp-minichip ev-tile ev-tone-{{ d | eventTone }}" aria-hidden="true"><span>{{ d.chip.mon }}</span><strong>{{ d.chip.day }}</strong></span>
        <span class="min-w-0">
          <a class="mp-drow-t tap-link font-semibold text-ink no-underline hover:text-gv hover:underline" href="{{ d.href | lurl(lang) }}"{% if d.external %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}>{{ ("monthly.committee" | t(lang)) if d.kind == "committee" else d.title }}{% if d.external %}<span class="sr-only"> ({{ "common.external" | t(lang) }})</span>{% endif %}</a>
          {#- the "Over" badge: this month's rows only (a later month's dates are all still to come) -#}
          <span class="block text-sm text-muted">{% if m.isCurrent %}<span class="badge-muted mr-1" data-mp-over-badge{% if not over %} hidden{% endif %}>{{ "monthly.over" | t(lang) }}</span> {% endif %}{{ d.day }}{% if d.endDay %} – {{ d.endDay }}{% endif %}{% if d.time %} · {{ d.time }} {{ d.zone }}{% endif %}{% if d.kind == "committee" %} · {{ d.platform }}{% elif d.place %} · {{ d.place }}{% elif d.online and not d.city %} · {{ "monthly.online" | t(lang) }}{% endif %}{% if d.tentative %} · {{ "committee.events.tentative" | t(lang) }}{% endif %}</span>
        </span>
      </li>
      {% endmacro %}
      <section id="mp-dates" class="card card-pad" aria-labelledby="mp-dates-title">
        <h3 id="mp-dates-title" class="card-h"><span>{% icon "calendar-days", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "monthly.dates" | t(lang) }}</h3>
        {% if upcoming.length %}
        <ul class="mt-3 divide-y divide-line" role="list">{% for d in upcoming %}{{ dateRow(d) }}{% endfor %}</ul>
        {% else %}
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">{{ ("monthly.no_more_dates" if m.dates.length else "monthly.no_dates") | t(lang) }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        {%- set nc = nx.nextCommittee if nx else null -%}
        {% if nc and not nc.thisMonth %}
        <p class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-start gap-x-2 gap-y-1 rounded-xl bg-gv-soft p-3 text-sm">
          <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-gv">{% icon "video", "size-4" %}</span>
          <span class="min-w-0 flex-1"><strong class="text-ink">{{ "monthly.next_meeting" | t(lang) }}:</strong> {{ nc.day }} · {{ nc.time }} {{ nc.zone }} · {{ nc.platform }}</span>
          <a class="link tap-link gap-1 font-semibold" href="{{ '/meetings/' | lurl(lang) }}#committee-meeting">{{ "monthly.meeting_link" | t(lang) }}<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></a>
        </p>
        {% endif %}
        {% if earlier.length %}
        <details class="cm-preview mt-3 rounded-xl border border-line">
          <summary class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 px-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink">{% icon "history", "size-4 shrink-0 text-muted" %} {{ "monthly.earlier" | t(lang, { month: m.monthName, n: earlier.length }) }}</summary>
          <ul class="divide-y divide-line border-t border-line px-3" role="list">{% for d in earlier %}{{ dateRow(d) }}{% endfor %}</ul>
        </details>
        {% endif %}
        {#- "Add October's dates to my calendar": the month's calendar file (a static file beside this page: the
            dates above and the story deadlines; opens in a phone's calendar, no script) -#}
        {% if upcoming.length or m.deadlines.length or m.lvDeadlines.length %}
        <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl bg-surface-2 p-3">
          <a class="link tap-link inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold" href="{{ m.icsUrl }}" type="text/calendar">{% icon "calendar-plus", "size-4 shrink-0" %} {{ "monthly.ics_link" | t(lang, { month: m.monthName }) }}</a>
          <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ "monthly.ics_note" | t(lang) }}</p>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
        {#- the same "link + arrow" footer as the other cards -#}
        <p class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6">
          <a class="link tap-link inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold" href="{{ '/events/' | lurl(lang) }}">{{ "monthly.events_link" | t(lang) }} {% icon "arrow-right", "size-4" %}</a>
          <a class="link tap-link inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold" href="{{ '/meetings/' | lurl(lang) }}#committee-meeting">{{ "monthly.meeting_link" | t(lang) }} {% icon "arrow-right", "size-4" %}</a>
        </p>
      </section>

      {#- Every week: the weekly open meetings (La Viña's from its first date); the current month adds how many
          Grapevine meetings there are near you (their one home: /meetings/#grapevine-meetings) -#}
      {% if m.weekly.length or gvmLive %}
      <section id="mp-weekly" class="card card-pad" aria-labelledby="mp-weekly-title">
        <h3 id="mp-weekly-title" class="card-h"><span class="text-vine">{% icon "video", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "monthly.every_week" | t(lang) }}</h3>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-3" role="list">
          {% for w in m.weekly %}
          <li class="min-w-0"><strong class="text-ink">{{ w.title }}</strong>{% if w.new %} <span class="badge-new">{{ "monthly.new" | t(lang) }}</span>{% endif %}<span class="block text-sm text-muted">{{ w.when }}{% if w.startsLabel %} · {{ "monthly.weekly_from" | t(lang, { date: w.startsLabel }) }}{% endif %}</span></li>
          {% endfor %}
          {% if gvmLive %}
          {%- set ours = ("committee.gvm.count_one" if gvmLive.inArea == 1 else "committee.gvm.count") | t(lang, { n: gvmLive.inArea }) -%}
          <li class="relative flex min-w-0 items-start gap-2">
            <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-gv">{% icon "map-pin", "size-4" %}</span>
            <span class="min-w-0"><a class="font-semibold text-ink no-underline after:absolute after:inset-0 hover:text-gv hover:underline" href="{{ '/meetings/' | lurl(lang) }}#grapevine-meetings">{{ "committee.gvm.home_title" | t(lang) }}</a><span class="block text-sm text-muted">{{ ("committee.gvm.home_text" if gvmLive.nearby else "committee.gvm.home_text_area") | t(lang, { ours: ours, nearby: gvmLive.nearby }) }}</span></span>
          </li>
          {% endif %}
        </ul>
        {% if m.weekly.length %}<a class="link tap-link mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold" href="{{ '/meetings/' | lurl(lang) }}#weekly-open">{{ "monthly.weekly_link" | t(lang) }} {% icon "arrow-right", "size-4" %}</a>{% endif %}
      </section>
      {% endif %}

      {#- Stories wanted (La Viña first in Spanish; the first card is #mp-stories). How to send a story and
          how to record one by phone have ONE home: /contribute/ (#submit, #deadlines, #record). La Viña's
          deadlines of the month (its yearly themes) come first in its card: the theme in La Viña's own Spanish
          words (lang="es"), on the English page its English words under it -#}
      {% set lvCard %}
      <article class="card card-pad"{% if lang == "es" %} id="mp-stories"{% endif %}>
        <h3 class="card-h"><span class="text-lv">{% icon "pen-line", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "monthly.share_story_lv" | t(lang) }}</h3>
        {% if m.lvDeadlines.length %}
        <ul class="mt-2 divide-y divide-line" role="list">
          {% for d in m.lvDeadlines %}
          <li class="py-3">
            <p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink" lang="{{ d.themeLang }}">{{ d.theme }}</p>
            {% if d.gloss %}<p class="text-sm text-muted">{{ d.gloss }}{% if d.glossMachine %} <span class="auto-note align-middle" title="{{ 'common.auto_translated' | t(lang) }} — {{ 'common.auto_translated_help' | t(lang) }}">{% icon "languages", "size-3" %}<span class="sr-only">{{ "common.auto_translated" | t(lang) }}</span></span>{% endif %}</p>{% endif %}
            <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-lv-strong">{{ "monthly.for_issue" | t(lang, { issue: d.issueLabel }) }} — {{ "monthly.due" | t(lang, { date: d.dueLong }) }}</p>
          </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        {% endif %}
        {% if m.lvTopics.length %}
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">{{ "monthly.lv_topics" | t(lang) }}</p>
        <ul class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2" role="list">{% for tp in m.lvTopics %}<li class="badge-lv" lang="es">{{ tp.es }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
        {% endif %}
        {#- how to send (e-mail, guidelines) has ONE home: /contribute/ (the poster keeps the e-mail for print) -#}
        <p class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-1">
          <a class="link tap-link inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold" href="{{ '/contribute/' | lurl(lang) }}#submit">{{ "monthly.lv_send_link" | t(lang) }} {% icon "arrow-right", "size-4" %}</a>
          <a class="link tap-link inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold" href="{{ '/contribute/' | lurl(lang) }}#record">{{ "monthly.record_link" | t(lang) }} {% icon "arrow-right", "size-4" %}</a>
        </p>
      </article>
      {% endset %}
      {% set gvCard %}
      <article class="card card-pad"{% if lang != "es" %} id="mp-stories"{% endif %}>
        <h3 class="card-h"><span>{% icon "pen-line", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "monthly.share_story" | t(lang) }}</h3>
        {% if lang == "es" %}<p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-gv">{{ "monthly.gv_english" | t(lang) }}</p>{% endif %}
        {% if m.deadlines.length %}
        {#- one divided list (no boxes inside the card) -#}
        <ul class="mt-2 divide-y divide-line" role="list">
          {% for d in m.deadlines %}
          <li class="py-3">
            <p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">{{ d.theme }}</p>
            {{ mp.orig({ machine: d.machine, orig: d.themeEn if d.themeEn != d.theme else "" }, lang, "en") }}
            <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-gv">{{ "monthly.for_issue" | t(lang, { issue: d.issueLabel }) }} — {{ "monthly.due" | t(lang, { date: d.dueLong }) }}</p>
          </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        {% if m.deadlines | selectattr("machine") | length %}{{ mtNote | safe }}{% endif %}
        {% else %}
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">{{ "monthly.no_deadlines" | t(lang) }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        {#- the full prompts, the e-mail and the guidelines have ONE home: /contribute/#deadlines -#}
        <p class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-1">
          <a class="link tap-link inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold" href="{{ '/contribute/' | lurl(lang) }}#deadlines">{{ "monthly.deadlines_link" | t(lang) }} {% icon "arrow-right", "size-4" %}</a>
          <a class="link tap-link inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold" href="{{ '/contribute/' | lurl(lang) }}#record">{{ "monthly.record_link" | t(lang) }} {% icon "arrow-right", "size-4" %}</a>
        </p>
      </article>
      {% endset %}
      {% if lang == "es" %}{{ lvCard | safe }}{{ gvCard | safe }}{% else %}{{ gvCard | safe }}{{ lvCard | safe }}{% endif %}

      {#- Book of the Month: essentials only; prices live in the shop. The current month shows the offers not
          over yet (one that ends while the page is open is marked "Over" by the browser). -#}
      {% if botmShown.length %}
      <section id="mp-botm" class="card card-pad" aria-labelledby="mp-botm-title">
        <h3 id="mp-botm-title" class="card-h"><span class="text-grape">{% icon "book-heart", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "monthly.botm" | t(lang) }}</h3>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2" role="list">
          {% for b in botmShown %}
          <li class="mp-drow min-w-0"{% if m.isCurrent %} data-mp-over="{{ b.overAt }}"{% endif %}><strong class="mp-drow-t text-ink" lang="{{ b.lang }}">{{ b.title }}</strong> <span class="text-sm text-muted">{% if m.isCurrent %}<span class="badge-muted mr-1" data-mp-over-badge hidden>{{ "monthly.over" | t(lang) }}</span> {% endif %}— {{ ("monthly.botm_off" | t(lang, { pct: b.discount, date: b.endsLabel })) if b.discount else ("monthly.botm_until" | t(lang, { date: b.endsLabel })) }}</span></li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <a class="link tap-link mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold" href="{{ '/shop/' | lurl(lang) }}#botm">{{ "monthly.botm_more" | t(lang) }} {% icon "arrow-right", "size-4" %}</a>
      </section>
      {% endif %}

      {#- Keep up all month (the current month only): one line each pointing to the page that is the home of
          what changes during the month — never a copy of it: the daily quote (only while the home page shows
          one), What's New since the 1st, the Bulletin (its newest post), Instagram, the subscription price. -#}
      {% if nx %}
      <section id="mp-keep" class="card card-pad" aria-labelledby="mp-keep-title">
        <h3 id="mp-keep-title" class="card-h"><span class="text-grape">{% icon "sparkles", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "monthly.keep_title" | t(lang) }}</h3>
        <ul class="mp-keep mt-2 divide-y divide-line" role="list">
          {% if nx.quote %}
          <li>
            <span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-gv-soft text-gv" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "quote", "size-4" %}</span>
            <span class="min-w-0"><strong class="block text-ink">{{ "home.quote_title" | t(lang) }}</strong><span class="block text-sm text-muted">{{ "monthly.quote_line" | t(lang) }}</span><a class="link font-semibold after:absolute after:inset-0" href="{{ '/' | lurl(lang) }}#quote-title">{{ "monthly.quote_link" | t(lang) }}<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></a></span>
          </li>
          {% endif %}
          <li>
            <span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-vine-soft text-vine" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "sparkles", "size-4" %}</span>
            <span class="min-w-0"><a class="font-semibold text-ink no-underline after:absolute after:inset-0 hover:text-gv hover:underline" href="{{ '/whats-new/' | lurl(lang) }}">{{ "nav.whats_new" | t(lang) }}</a><span class="block text-sm text-muted">{% if nx.news.n %}{{ ("monthly.news_line_one" if nx.news.n == 1 else "monthly.news_line") | t(lang, { n: nx.news.n | cmNum(lang), date: nx.news.sinceLabel }) }}{% else %}{{ "monthly.news_none" | t(lang) }}{% endif %}</span></span>
          </li>
          {#- the Bulletin row has two links (the bulletin, its newest post): no link covers this row, each one
              is its own target (tap-link: 44px on phones; at least 24px with a mouse, monthly.css), and the
              number of posts is said in words -#}
          {% if nx.bulletin.n %}
          <li>
            <span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-vine-soft text-vine" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "megaphone", "size-4" %}</span>
            <span class="min-w-0"><a class="tap-link font-semibold text-ink no-underline hover:text-gv hover:underline" href="{{ '/bulletin/' | lurl(lang) }}">{{ "nav.bulletin" | t(lang) }}</a><span class="block text-sm text-muted">{{ ("monthly.bulletin_n_one" if nx.bulletin.n == 1 else "monthly.bulletin_n") | t(lang, { n: nx.bulletin.n }) }}</span>{% if nx.bulletin.top %}<a class="link tap-link text-sm" href="{{ nx.bulletin.top.href | lurl(lang) }}">{{ nx.bulletin.top.title }}</a>{% endif %}</span>
          </li>
          {% endif %}
          {% if nx.instagram.length %}
          <li>
            <span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-grape-soft text-grape" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "instagram", "size-4" %}</span>
            <span class="min-w-0"><a class="font-semibold text-ink no-underline after:absolute after:inset-0 hover:text-gv hover:underline" href="{{ '/instagram/' | lurl(lang) }}">{{ "nav.instagram" | t(lang) }}</a><span class="mp-handles block text-sm text-muted">{% for p in nx.instagram %}@{{ p.username }}{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}</span></span>
          </li>
          {% endif %}
          {#- a price change AA Grapevine announced (shop.json price_changes): the prices side by side until its
              day, the new prices from it through its notice_until — each row in its window (ui.when: the page
              switches by itself at midnight Central). The link says what it opens (/shop/#price-changes), never
              the headline: the Bulletin row above may show the post with that title; the day is in its line. -#}
          {% for pc in (db.shop | shopPriceChanges(lang)) %}{% for part in ["before", "after"] %}{% set n = pc[part] %}{% if n %}
          <li{{ ui.when(n.win) }}>
            <span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-gv-soft text-gv" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "calendar-clock", "size-4" %}</span>
            <span class="min-w-0"><a class="font-semibold text-ink no-underline after:absolute after:inset-0 hover:text-gv hover:underline" href="{{ '/shop/' | lurl(lang) }}#price-changes">{{ ("monthly.pc_link_" + part) | t(lang) }}</a><span class="block text-sm text-muted">{{ ("monthly.pc_" + part) | t(lang, { date: pc.date }) }}</span></span>
          </li>
          {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endfor %}
          {% if nx.subsFrom %}
          <li>
            <span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-lv-soft text-lv" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "newspaper", "size-4" %}</span>
            <span class="min-w-0"><a class="font-semibold text-ink no-underline after:absolute after:inset-0 hover:text-gv hover:underline" href="{{ '/shop/' | lurl(lang) }}#subscriptions">{{ "shop.subs_from" | t(lang, { amount: nx.subsFrom | shopMoney(lang) }) }}</a><span class="block text-sm text-muted">{{ "home.subs_desc" | t(lang) }}</span></span>
          </li>
          {% endif %}
        </ul>
      </section>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <nav class="mp-pager mp-no-print" aria-label="{{ 'monthly.back_hub' | t(lang) }}">
    {% if m.hasPrev %}<a class="btn-secondary" href="{{ ('/monthly/' + m.prev + '/') | lurl(lang) }}" rel="prev">{% icon "chevron-left", "size-4" %} <span>{{ "monthly.prev" | t(lang) }}<span class="mp-pager-m">{{ (all[m.index - 1]).title }}</span></span></a>{% else %}<span></span>{% endif %}
    {% if m.hasNext %}<a class="btn-secondary mp-pager-next" href="{{ ('/monthly/' + m.next + '/') | lurl(lang) }}" rel="next"><span>{{ "monthly.next" | t(lang) }}<span class="mp-pager-m">{{ (all[m.index + 1]).title }}</span></span> {% icon "chevron-right", "size-4" %}</a>{% endif %}
  </nav>
</section>
